From: halt95 <halt95@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 04:17:29 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 23/58] sched: preserve per-group eviction order in deferred
 block free (port of upstream #48532)

The deferred free path flattened every KV cache group into one list and
reversed it once, so group order came out backwards relative to the immediate
free path. The reversal moves into pop_blocks_for_free.
